{"id":1254,"mal_id":1254,"title":"Saint Seiya","englishTitle":"Saint Seiya: Knights of the Zodiac","title_english":"Saint Seiya: Knights of the Zodiac","alternative_titles":{"synonyms":["Knights of the Zodiac","Zodiac Knights"],"en":"Saint Seiya: Knights of the Zodiac","ja":"聖闘士星矢(セイントセイヤ)"},"synopsis":"In ancient times, a group of young men devoted their lives to protecting Athena, the Goddess of Wisdom and War. These men were capable of fighting without weapons—a swing of their fist alone was powerful enough to rip the very sky apart and shatter the earth beneath them. These brave heroes became known as Saints, as they could summon up the power of the Cosmos from within themselves.\n\nNow, in present day, a new generation of Saints is about to come forth. The young and spirited Seiya is fighting a tough battle for the Sacred Armor of Pegasus, and he isn't about to let anyone get in the way of him and his prize. Six years of hard work and training pay off with his victory and new title as one of Athena's Saints.\n\nBut Seiya's endeavor doesn't end there. In fact, plenty of perils and dangerous enemies face him and the rest of the Saints throughout the series. What new quests await the heroes of the epic Saint Seiya saga?","synopsis_es":"En la antigüedad, un grupo de jóvenes dedicó su vida a proteger a Atenea, la diosa de la sabiduría y la guerra. Estos hombres eran capaces de luchar sin armas; un solo movimiento de su puño era lo suficientemente poderoso como para destrozar el cielo y hacer añicos la tierra debajo de ellos. Estos valientes héroes llegaron a ser conocidos como Santos, ya que podían invocar el poder del Cosmos desde dentro de sí mismos.\n\nAhora, en la actualidad, una nueva generación de santos está a punto de surgir. El joven y enérgico Seiya está librando una dura batalla por la Armadura Sagrada de Pegaso, y no está dispuesto a permitir que nadie se interponga en su camino y el de su premio. Seis años de arduo trabajo y entrenamiento dieron sus frutos con su victoria y su nuevo título como uno de los Santos de Atenas.\n\nPero el esfuerzo de Seiya no termina ahí. De hecho, él y el resto de los santos se enfrentan a muchos peligros y enemigos peligrosos a lo largo de la serie. ¿Qué nuevas misiones esperan a los héroes de la épica saga Saint Seiya?","type":"TV","media_type":"tv","status":"finished_airing","averageEpisodeDurationSeconds":1440,"average_episode_duration":1440,"startDate":"1986-10-11","start_date":"1986-10-11","endDate":"1989-04-01","end_date":"1989-04-01","season":"fall","year":1986,"start_season":{"year":1986,"season":"fall"},"episodes":114,"num_episodes":114,"score":7.78,"mean":7.78,"numListUsers":208029,"num_list_users":208029,"genres":[{"id":1,"name":"Action"},{"id":2,"name":"Adventure"},{"id":10,"name":"Fantasy"},{"id":6,"name":"Mythology"},{"id":24,"name":"Sci-Fi"},{"id":27,"name":"Shounen"}],"studios":[{"id":18,"name":"Toei Animation"}],"pictures":[],"backdrop_url":null,"logo_url":null,"tmdb_id":null,"tmdb_updated_at":null,"images":{"jpg":{"image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1180/133782.webp","large_image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1180/133782l.webp"}},"main_picture":{"medium":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1180/133782.webp","large":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1180/133782l.webp"},"trailer":{"images":{"maximum_image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1180/133782l.webp"}},"broadcast":{"day":"saturday","time":"19:00","day_of_the_week":"saturday","start_time":"19:00","timezone":"Asia/Tokyo","string":"saturday 19:00"},"rank":1254,"popularity":1387,"rating":"pg_13","simkl_id":null,"episodes_data":[],"specials_data":[],"characters":[],"num_scoring_users":109970,"nsfw":"white","created_at":"2006-08-06T06:46:32+00:00","updated_at":"2023-04-22T21:03:23+00:00","source":"manga","background":"The series won the 1987 Animage's Anime Grand Prix Award.","related_anime":[{"node":{"id":1255,"title":"Saint Seiya: Shinku no Shounen Dense